  "legalTermsS1Body": "Ventus helps you plan and organize trips. Use it only for lawful, personal purposes, and do not misuse, copy, or try to disrupt the service. AI-generated plans and suggestions are for guidance only — always verify times, prices, visas, and bookings yourself.",
