  "helpQ1": "How do I create a trip?",
  "helpA1": "Tap the + button in the middle of the home screen, then pick the place and dates. You can also choose “Plan with AI” and describe your trip in a sentence — it finds the place, dates and who's going.",
  "helpQ2": "How does the AI plan work?",
  "helpA2": "On your trip's page tap “Generate my plan” and Ventus suggests a day-by-day plan. It's guidance only — always double-check times, prices and bookings yourself.",
  "helpQ3": "Does it work offline?",
  "helpA3": "Your trips, day plan, checklist and budget are stored on your phone and open without internet. They sync when you're back online. AI, maps, weather and currency need internet.",
  "helpQ4": "Where are my documents stored?",
  "helpA4": "Your tickets and other documents are kept securely in private storage that only you can open. Nobody sees them unless you share them.",
  "helpQ5": "How do I open a place on the map?",
  "helpA5": "In the day plan tap the compass icon on the right of an activity card. The maps and taxi apps on your phone appear — pick one.",
  "helpQ6": "How do I delete my account?",
  "helpA6": "Profile → Privacy & security → Delete account. This permanently deletes your account and all your trips and can't be undone."
